\begin_layout Plain Layout
A parametric quantum circuit.
 Consider the transformation of 
\begin_inset Formula $\ket{0}$
\end_inset

 to state 
\begin_inset Formula $\ket{\psi}$
\end_inset

:
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
\ket{\psi}=\mathbf{R}_{z}\left(\theta_{z}\right)\mathbf{R}_{x}\left(\theta_{x}\right)\ket{0}.\label{eq:DrivenQCA-Ansatz}
\end{equation}

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
